{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36172","headline":"赠邻居袁明府 · 方干","name":"赠邻居袁明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隔竹每呼皆得应，二心亲熟更如何。\n文章锻链犹相似，年齿参差不校多。\n雨後卷帘看越岭，更深欹枕听湖波。\n朝昏幸得同醒醉，遮莫光阴自下坡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}